## Why this fork exists

EDS Lite's source has not been touched since 2020-04-21. Its successor, EDS NG,
is closed source and paywalls the features that matter most for the threat model
this fork targets: hidden volumes, keyfiles, and container-wide search.

Those features are not missing from the open source engine, only disabled in it.
The container layer already carries hidden-volume plumbing throughout
(EdsContainerBase.tryLayout(..., isHidden), ContainerFormatInfo.getHiddenVolumeLayout(),
and StdLayout reserving four header slots including the hidden volume header).
What the lite build does is override a handful of methods to answer "no":

  app/src/lite/java/com/sovworks/eds/truecrypt/FormatInfo.java
    hasHiddenContainerSupport() -> false
    hasKeyfilesSupport()        -> false
    getHiddenVolumeLayout()     -> null
    getMaxPasswordLength()      -> 64

FDS keeps the engine and removes the paywall.
